---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { brandFor } from '@/config/brand';

const brand = brandFor('en');
---

<LegalLayout title="Legal notice" updated="July 2026" path="/aviso-legal">
  <h2>1. Identifying information</h2>
  <p>
    In compliance with Spanish Law 34/2002 on Information Society Services and Electronic Commerce
    (LSSI-CE), the details of the owner of this website are provided below:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Owner: Cogniplex SL</li>
    <li>Tax ID (CIF): B93768182</li>
    <li>Registered office: C/ Rosselló 198, 3ª 2ª, 08008 Barcelona (Spain)</li>
    <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}>{brand.email}</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Purpose</h2>
  <p>
    The purpose of this website is to present the services of {brand.name} and to facilitate
    contact with the firm. Accessing and using the site confers the status of user and implies
    acceptance of this legal notice.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Intellectual and industrial property</h2>
  <p>
    The contents of this site (texts, brand, logo, symbol, design and code) are owned by
    {brand.name} or by third parties who have authorised their use, and are protected by
    intellectual and industrial property law. Their reproduction without express authorisation is
    prohibited.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Liability</h2>
  <p>
    {brand.name} is not liable for any misuse of the contents of the site, which is the sole
    responsibility of the person who accesses or uses them.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Applicable law</h2>
  <p>
    This legal notice is governed by Spanish law. For any dispute, the parties submit to the courts
    and tribunals with jurisdiction under the law.
  </p>

</LegalLayout>
